[25.894965, "o", "\r\n==========================================================\r\n  dd-honeypot stack (--deep)\r\n==========================================================\r\n  Target  : 127.0.0.1\r\n  Score   : 88%\r\n  Verdict : Confirmed Honeypot\r\n\r\n  Key findings:\r\n  • [SSH:28223] SSH static banner signature — SSH-2.0-OpenSSH_5.1p1 Debian-5\r\n  • [HTTP:28080] HTTP TCP accepts then returns no response — TCP accept; request sent; no HTTP bytes before timeout\r\n  • [MYSQL:28306] MySQL greeting is an EOL 5.5.x ubuntu template — EOL MySQL greeting 5.5.43-0ubuntu0.14.04.1\r\n  • [MYSQL:28306] MySQL handshake uses stock capability/auth-plugin template — stock handshake capability block + mysql_native_password"]
[28.894965, "o", "\r\n  • [MYSQL:28306] MySQL drops the session after one access-denied — 1045 then connection closed (no retry window)\r\n  • [TCP:28223] Idle TCP handshakes accepted with no backoff — accepted 10/10 idle connects mean=0.1ms\r\n  … and 2 more (see JSON report)\r\n==========================================================\r\n\r\n"]
[28.922533, "o", "\r\n  Confidence : medium\r\n  Tactical   : SKIP_TARGET\r\n  Triggers   : 8\r\n    • ssh.banner — SSH-2.0-OpenSSH_5.1p1 Debian-5\r\n    • http.silent_accept — TCP accept; request sent; no HTTP bytes before timeout\r\n    • mysql.signature — EOL MySQL greeting 5.5.43-0ubuntu0.14.04.1\r\n    • mysql.handshake — stock handshake capability block + mysql_native_password\r\n    • mysql.persist — 1045 then connection closed (no retry window)\r\n    • deep.idle_accept — accepted 10/10 idle connects mean=0.1ms\r\n    • deep.latency_under_load — baseline_mean=5.5ms load_mean=3.3ms load_cv=0.097 stretch=0.60x n=8\r\n    • corroboration.protocol_buffet — +10% for 3 protocol lures (>1 at 5% each): http, mysql, ssh\r\n\r\n"]
[28.952465, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[38;5;244m▸ reading pause — deep stack/FSM tells — read the verdict and triggers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
