[45.558331, "o", "Why this score\r\n"]
[48.558331, "o", "  • [smb:29445] (medium) SMB TCP accepts then returns no protocol response — TCP accept; SMB/NETBIOS\r\nsession timed out without a dialect (The NETBIOS connection with the remote host timed out.)\r\n"]
[48.558367, "o", "  • [http:29080] (medium) HTTP TCP accepts then returns no response — TCP accept; request sent; no \r\nHTTP bytes before timeout\r\n  • [httpproxy:28128] (medium) HTTP proxy port TCP accepts then returns no response — TCP accept; \r\nproxy request sent; no HTTP bytes before timeout\r\n  • [multi] (medium) Multiple ports accept TCP then return no application response — 3 silent-accept\r\nfaces across http, httpproxy, smb\r\n  • [multi] (medium) Multiple protocol tells corroborate the same host — +10% for 3 protocol lures \r\n(>1 at 5% each): http, httpproxy, smb\r\n"]
[48.558392, "o", "preset=both timeout=6.0s deep=False\r\n"]
[48.55845, "o", "Closed ports are skipped and do not raise the score.\r\n"]
[48.558559, "o", "-p/--port selects only the listed ports (preset not applied)\r\n"]
[48.558692, "o", "ports ssh:29080,29445,28128 http:29080 smb:29445 httpproxy:28128\r\n"]
[48.558799, "o", "Nmap omitted by default; pass --with-nmap / -n for -sV/NSE tells.\r\n"]
[48.559797, "o", "Report written to /tmp/hpa-tarpit-demo.json\r\n"]
